#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_l10n_jp
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Overview:\n"
"---------\n"
"\n"
"* Chart of Accounts and Taxes template for companies in Japan.\n"
"* This probably does not cover all the necessary accounts for a company. You "
"are expected to add/delete/modify accounts based on this template.\n"
"\n"
"Note:\n"
"-----\n"
"\n"
"* Fiscal positions '内税' and '外税' have been added to handle special "
"requirements which might arise from POS implementation. [1]  Under normal "
"circumstances, you might not need to use those at all.\n"
"\n"
"[1] See https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/6470 for detail.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Vue d'ensemble :\n"
"---------\n"
"\n"
"* Modèle de plan comptable et de taxes pour les entreprises au Japon.\n"
"* Ce modèle ne couvre probablement pas tous les comptes nécessaire à une "
"entreprise. Vous devez ajouter/supprimer/modifier les comptes sur base de ce "
"modèle.\n"
"\n"
"Remarque :\n"
"-----\n"
"\n"
"* Les positions fiscales '内税' et '外税' ont été ajoutées pour répondre aux "
"exigences particulières pouvant découler de la mise en oeuvre du PdV. [1]  "
"Dans des circonstances normales, il se peut que vous n'ayez pas besoin de "
"les utiliser.\n"
"\n"
"[1] See https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/6470 for detail.\n"
"\n"

