#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_account
msgid ""
"\n"
"Invoicing & Payments\n"
"====================\n"
"The specific and easy-to-use Invoicing system in Odoo allows you to keep "
"track of your accounting, even when you are not an accountant. It provides "
"an easy way to follow up on your vendors and customers.\n"
"\n"
"You could use this simplified accounting in case you work with an (external) "
"account to keep your books, and you still want to keep track of payments. "
"This module also offers you an easy method of registering payments, without "
"having to encode complete abstracts of account.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Facturation & Paiements\n"
"=====================\n"
"Le système de facturation ergonomique d'Odoo permet de garder une trace "
"comptable, même sans être un expert-comptable. Il fournit un suivi aisé des "
"fournisseurs et clients.\n"
"\n"
"On peut utiliser cette comptabilité simplifiée pour travailler avec un "
"comptable externe et de mettre à jour les livres. On peut toujours garder la "
"trace des paiements. Ce module offre également une méthode facile pour "
"enregistrer les paiements, sans avoir à saisir des résumés complets de "
"compte.\n"

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_device_machines
msgid ""
"\n"
"IoT Machines - Counter Telemetry\n"
"================================\n"
"\n"
"Counter-machine behaviour on ``device.device``, for PLCs publishing a\n"
"cumulative production counter over MQTT (Etiquetadora, Llenadora, ...).\n"
"\n"
"* counter devices are flagged by the ``counter_plc`` device category -- no\n"
"  parallel model\n"
"* the cumulative counter is aggregated into hourly buckets, one row per\n"
"  (device, hour): ~17,520 rows/year for two machines against ~4.2M raw pings\n"
"* the weekly PLC counter reset (payload ``Conteo=0``) is detected and rolls\n"
"  over to a new bucket\n"
"* the device's MQTT session is its ``integration.stream``: the stream worker\n"
"  dials AWS IoT Core with the device's client certificate and the profile's\n"
"  root authority (``remote``), and ``_on_stream_frame`` hands each counter\n"
"  payload to the aggregator instead of the raw ``device.data.log``\n"
msgstr ""

