"\n"
"This module allows you to add firstname and lastnames (father's and\n"
"mother's last names) in employee form, and concatenate both in name field.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to *Employees*\n"
"2. On the employee form view you will have 3 separate fields: First name,\n"
"   Last name and Second last name. One of First name or Last name is\n"
"   required; Second last name is optional.\n"
